File Index: 78 of 109
Audio ID: 7253767501413092664
Audio Duration: 10m 16.0s (615.99s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 12:04:08 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.97)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 如何變成一個狠人
Segment #2   [00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,500] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 第一步把嘴閉上
Segment #3   [00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:04,820] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 2  | Text: 記住
Segment #4   [00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,260] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 13 | Text: 連小狗都是這麼劃分的更何況是人
Segment #5   [00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,740] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 不亂叫的狗才要人對不對
Segment #6   [00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,160] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為我過去我是一個非常去
Segment #7   [00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,660] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 喜歡表達自己想法的人
Segment #8   [00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,620] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 非常愛說話的人
Segment #9   [00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,340] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 當我開始意識到
Segment #10  [00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,320] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 我是個傻逼的時候
Segment #11  [00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,260] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 那時候我已經閉不上嘴了
Segment #12  [00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,820] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 11 | Text: 我就變成了別人眼中的笑話
Segment #13  [00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,020] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 因為我說的話
Segment #14  [00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,820] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 可能會完全補不著編輯
Segment #15  [00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,520] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 甚至會把自己的想法
Segment #16  [00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,560] | Elapsed:  13.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 毫無保留地去分享給所有人
Segment #17  [00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,080] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 其實都暴露出來的時候
Segment #18  [00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,280] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 那個時候才是自己最無知的時候
Segment #19  [00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:33,840] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 然後後來呢
Segment #20  [00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,080] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就想明白了一件事
Segment #21  [00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,920] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是當我要去做什麼的時候
Segment #22  [00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,820] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 10 | Text: 就哪怕我身邊最親最近的人
Segment #23  [00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,560] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的父母
Segment #24  [00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,480] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 我的親人我都不要去接
Segment #25  [00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,140] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 我先去做
Segment #26  [00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,480] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 把結果做出來
Segment #27  [00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,040] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 結果自然回去說話
Segment #28  [00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,620] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 然後你偷偷不覺得講再多
Segment #29  [00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,480] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 最後落不了地
Segment #30  [00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,460] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者說做不起來
Segment #31  [00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,980] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 它都會變成一個
Segment #32  [00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,740] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 眾人眼中的笑話吧
Segment #33  [00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,840] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 然後我就是給自己強行的
Segment #34  [00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,320] | Elapsed:  27.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 加了一個要求
Segment #35  [00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,500] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是把嘴閉上
Segment #36  [00:00:58,960 --> 00:00:59,740] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 你記住
Segment #37  [00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:01,280] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 言多必失
Segment #38  [00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,280] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且其實我感覺
Segment #39  [00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,160] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是一個偷偷不覺的人
Segment #40  [00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,980] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 一定是一個這兒很空的人
Segment #41  [00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:08,700] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 那可能這個時候你會問我
Segment #42  [00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:10,860] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是一個人
Segment #43  [00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:12,240] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 既然偷偷不覺了
Segment #44  [00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:14,520] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 他可以面對什麼都能聊出來
Segment #45  [00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,420] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 看到鳥語 花草
Segment #46  [00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:17,040] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 看到大樹
Segment #47  [00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,340] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 12 | Text: 他都能聊出自己對大樹的間接
Segment #48  [00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,720] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 那他偷偷不覺
Segment #49  [00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,540] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定是這兒有
Segment #50  [00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:22,480] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 很有東西的人
Segment #51  [00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,800] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是一個腦子很空的人
Segment #52  [00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,300] | Elapsed:  43.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我告訴你
Segment #53  [00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:27,620] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 一個人如果說只能願意
Segment #54  [00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,080] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 按照自己本能說話的時候
Segment #55  [00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,560] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 那這個人一定是一個
Segment #56  [00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,280] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 這兒很空的人
Segment #57  [00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,420] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 他沒有腦子
Segment #58  [00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,580] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 因為他根本不知道
Segment #59  [00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:34,300] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 什麼叫做人
Segment #60  [00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:36,720] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 他只是去釋放自己的慾望
Segment #61  [00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:38,800] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 而不是去表達自己的間接
Segment #62  [00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:39,500] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 所以說呢
Segment #63  [00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,820] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 把自己變成一個狠人的第一步
Segment #64  [00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:43,600] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 把嘴閉上
Segment #65  [00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,700] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 然後就是聊到了
Segment #66  [00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:48,580] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 把自己變成一個狠人的第二個方法
Segment #67  [00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:49,900] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你要習慣孤獨
Segment #68  [00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,780] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 習慣自己待著
Segment #69  [00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,280] | Elapsed:  59.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 並且你要享受孤獨
Segment #70  [00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,180] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 曾經我就是一個群聚洞
Segment #71  [00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:57,300] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就感覺每天自己沉迷在
Segment #72  [00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,840] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 酒色猜息當中
Segment #73  [00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,760] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 我自己一個人
Segment #74  [00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,420] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 9  | Text: 我連五分鐘我都待不住
Segment #75  [00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:02,640] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 我必須出去找人
Segment #76  [00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,900] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 吃點喝點逛逛
Segment #77  [00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:04,580] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 2  | Text: 沒事呢
Segment #78  [00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:06,060] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 不喜歡自己一個人待著
Segment #79  [00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:08,860] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 10 | Text: 其實我就已經放棄了獨立思考
Segment #80  [00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,500] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 而我現在是一個什麼人
Segment #81  [00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,040] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 就算你把我放在一個
Segment #82  [00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,260] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 一個原始的一個聰明裡
Segment #83  [00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,820] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 10 | Text: 只要我自己有的吃有的喝
Segment #84  [00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:19,720] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一樣可以自己一個人待
Segment #85  [00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,680] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 很久很久
Segment #86  [00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,140] | Elapsed:  75.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 當你獨處以後
Segment #87  [00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:24,520] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 12 | Text: 你才會知道什麼叫做真正的思考
Segment #88  [00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,860] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就是一個特別愛思考的人
Segment #89  [00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,360] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 9  | Text: 有時候我跟我老婆在家裡
Segment #90  [00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,740] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 6  | Text: 我說你不要上課廳
Segment #91  [00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:31,800] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 7  | Text: 我說你從樓上別下來
Segment #92  [00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,300] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 6  | Text: 我要自己去想一些問題
Segment #93  [00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:35,020] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 7  | Text: 她都表示很不理解
Segment #94  [00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,300] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 9  | Text: 而且就是在我去思考問題的時候
Segment #95  [00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,260] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 9  | Text: 我發現這是一件非常累的事
Segment #96  [00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:43,020] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 12 | Text: 甚至思考是需要我們身上的能量
Segment #97  [00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,940] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 8  | Text: 有的時候我想不清楚一些問題的時候
Segment #98  [00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:45,940] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 5  | Text: 我會想很久
Segment #99  [00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:47,380] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是當我想完之後
Segment #100 [00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:48,000] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 4  | Text: 我會很餓
Segment #101 [00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 7  | Text: 我會開始大吃一頓
Segment #102 [00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,480] | Elapsed:  90.62s | Words: 5  | Text: 剛開始我還會
Segment #103 [00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:51,800] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 那麼人家怎麼回事
Segment #104 [00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,340] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 後來我想明白了
Segment #105 [00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,860] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 7  | Text: 這是我自己在思考的時候
Segment #106 [00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:57,920] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 所消耗的體力 腦力
Segment #107 [00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,980] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 10 | Text: 然後我通過吃飯來把它補回來
Segment #108 [00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:03,000] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 10 | Text: 所以變成一個狠人的第二件事
Segment #109 [00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是學會獨處
Segment #110 [00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,260] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 學會自處 學會孤獨
Segment #111 [00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,140] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 然後就是我們聊到
Segment #112 [00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:09,840] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 12 | Text: 把自己變成一個狠人的第三個點了
Segment #113 [00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,260] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一定要學會節制
Segment #114 [00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,900] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 節制自己的慾望
Segment #115 [00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:14,140] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 節制自己的情緒
Segment #116 [00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,820] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 節制自己的叛逆
Segment #117 [00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:17,820] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是你要在節制這件事情上
Segment #118 [00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:19,500] | Elapsed: 106.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 做到非常非常高的段位
Segment #119 [00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:22,860] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是不是不管你遇到
Segment #120 [00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:24,720] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 你遇到想怎麼說的
Segment #121 [00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,040] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 你可以不這樣說
Segment #122 [00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,780] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 想遇到你不想要的東西
Segment #123 [00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:28,980] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就無所謂
Segment #124 [00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:31,120] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 是你想遇到你想要的東西的時候
Segment #125 [00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,240] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 你敢去放棄
Segment #126 [00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,600] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 再敢去不要
Segment #127 [00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,360] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 再才是高端
Segment #128 [00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,060] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就像我一樣
Segment #129 [00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:36,300] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 我說澳門我說可以放
Segment #130 [00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:36,800] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 2  | Text: 就可以放
Segment #131 [00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,800] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 11 | Text: 我一定要全力的去奧運互聯玩
Segment #132 [00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,300] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 你記住
Segment #133 [00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,220] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 你想要的東西
Segment #134 [00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:42,060] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 別人也想要
Segment #135 [00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,420] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是如果說你能把自己
Segment #136 [00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:44,920] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 想要的東西讓出去
Segment #137 [00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:48,000] | Elapsed: 122.36s | Words: 11 | Text: 這個時候你才會真正的獲得人
Segment #138 [00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,520] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 誰啊
Segment #139 [00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,620] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 左右一匹這個誰
Segment #140 [00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,520] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 可能我的普通話不標準
Segment #141 [00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,420] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 你沒錯的聽啊
Segment #142 [00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:55,260] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 因為你知道一件事情
Segment #143 [00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:57,220] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 好的東西誰都想要
Segment #144 [00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,100] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 這是人的本能
Segment #145 [00:03:58,100 --> 00:03:58,800] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 這是人性
Segment #146 [00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,800] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 而反人性的就是
Segment #147 [00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,440] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 我想要的我不要
Segment #148 [00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,860] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 能做到這一點的人
Segment #149 [00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:04,800] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 絕對是個恨人
Segment #150 [00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,240] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 這個東西就要考慮
Segment #151 [00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,660] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 一個人的潛能性
Segment #152 [00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:08,320] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 你蓋房子
Segment #153 [00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,340] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 你蓋到這個房子的時候
Segment #154 [00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,580] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 你地氣沒打好
Segment #155 [00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:11,660] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 你知道繼續往上蓋
Segment #156 [00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:12,020] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 會塌
Segment #157 [00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:12,680] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是你還蓋
Segment #158 [00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,780] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 那就不行出問題了
Segment #159 [00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:14,380] | Elapsed: 139.02s | Words: 1  | Text: 對不對
Segment #160 [00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:17,860] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 你代表的不要
Segment #161 [00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:19,360] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是現階段的不要
Segment #162 [00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:20,980] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是真的不要
Segment #163 [00:04:20,980 --> 00:04:22,220] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 而是代表的
Segment #164 [00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:23,400] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 你對某件事物
Segment #165 [00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,340] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 已經不再重要
Segment #166 [00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:25,520] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 而你想要的是
Segment #167 [00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,360] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 更多的東西
Segment #168 [00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:26,380] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 1  | Text: 對不對
Segment #169 [00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:28,720] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 那句話怎麼說來著
Segment #170 [00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,800] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 煙去暗之
Segment #171 [00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,560] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 紅苦之之
Segment #172 [00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,700] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以這是變成
Segment #173 [00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:32,280] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 一個恨人的
Segment #174 [00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,080] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 第三件事就是截至
Segment #175 [00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,420] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 甚至有的時候
Segment #176 [00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:36,280] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 你都要截至
Segment #177 [00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,420] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 彩和截至四
Segment #178 [00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:38,880] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果說這兩件事
Segment #179 [00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:39,760] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 你都能截至的話
Segment #180 [00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,740] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 那這時候你基本上
Segment #181 [00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:42,020] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是一個硬漢了
Segment #182 [00:04:42,020 --> 00:04:43,400] | Elapsed: 155.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是一個真心英雄了
Segment #183 [00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:45,720] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 變成一個恨人的第四條
Segment #184 [00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,460] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是學會下狠心
Segment #185 [00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,580] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 甚至說叫無情
Segment #186 [00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,440] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 有一句話是這樣講的
Segment #187 [00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,980] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 叫做大愛無情
Segment #188 [00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,440] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 我有一個例子
Segment #189 [00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,560] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 一個部隊的軍人
Segment #190 [00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,140] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 當他入伍以後
Segment #191 [00:04:57,140 --> 00:04:58,320] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 他會接受這個世界上
Segment #192 [00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,360] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 最嚴格的
Segment #193 [00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,360] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 最殘酷的訓練
Segment #194 [00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,960] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 甚至訓練他的人
Segment #195 [00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,100] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 都會不講理
Segment #196 [00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,280] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 還會去摧毀他的精神
Segment #197 [00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:05,940] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 肉體
Segment #198 [00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:08,620] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 摧毀他的身體極限
Segment #199 [00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:09,460] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 讓他付出代價
Segment #200 [00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:10,340] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 然後去訓練他
Segment #201 [00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,420] | Elapsed: 171.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 那麼我想問的是
Segment #202 [00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:13,820] | Elapsed: 186.72s | Words: 10 | Text: 就在他訓練的過程之中
Segment #203 [00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:14,620] | Elapsed: 186.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 他的教官
Segment #204 [00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:15,680] | Elapsed: 186.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 或者說他的長官吧
Segment #205 [00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,120] | Elapsed: 186.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 對他來說
Segment #206 [00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,560] | Elapsed: 186.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 是不是叫做大愛無情
Segment #207 [00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:19,540] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 1  | Text: 為什麼
Segment #208 [00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:20,860] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 因為他的教官
Segment #209 [00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:22,440] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 非常明白一件事
Segment #210 [00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,400] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我還把天天
Segment #211 [00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,300] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 讓你在家睡覺
Segment #212 [00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,500] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 3  | Text: 不鍛煉
Segment #213 [00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:27,800] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 不摧毀你的意志
Segment #214 [00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,460] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 不讓你突破身體的極限
Segment #215 [00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:30,680] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果說
Segment #216 [00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,720] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 到了戰場上
Segment #217 [00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:34,560] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 3  | Text: 那可能第一個
Segment #218 [00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:36,780] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 第一個這個
Segment #219 [00:05:36,780 --> 00:05:37,700] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 不接的就是你
Segment #220 [00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,600] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 絕對第一個死的就是你
Segment #221 [00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,000] | Elapsed: 186.73s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以說這叫大愛無情
Segment #222 [00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:42,380] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以你記住了
Segment #223 [00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,400] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果說當你不能忍受一些人
Segment #224 [00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:47,000] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 忍受一些小委屈
Segment #225 [00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,340] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 然後你現在去照顧一隻
Segment #226 [00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,320] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 小魔小狗的一樣去照顧他的時候
Segment #227 [00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,400] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 你記住你這樣
Segment #228 [00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,400] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是對別人好
Segment #229 [00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,140] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不是真的對別人好
Segment #230 [00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,920] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 我身邊的人都讓我罵眼
Segment #231 [00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,000] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 罵得都掉眼淚
Segment #232 [00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,700] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 我感覺我
Segment #233 [00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,720] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 站在我的角度
Segment #234 [00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,840] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 我是在幫助一個人
Segment #235 [00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:04,500] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 我不是在摧毀他
Segment #236 [00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:05,640] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是在幫他
Segment #237 [00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:06,900] | Elapsed: 202.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 因為一個人
Segment #238 [00:06:06,900 --> 00:06:08,160] | Elapsed: 202.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 真正能夠穿越了
Segment #239 [00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,460] | Elapsed: 202.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 這些無情的東西的時候
Segment #240 [00:06:09,460 --> 00:06:10,400] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 他最終
Segment #241 [00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,640] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 才能站起來
Segment #242 [00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,900] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 變成站起來的那個人
Segment #243 [00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:17,420] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 這就是當你真正的做到老人
Segment #244 [00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:18,720] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 受一個人在你面前
Segment #245 [00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,780] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 所撐住的痛苦
Segment #246 [00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,420] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 你明明知道
Segment #247 [00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,940] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 這個痛苦
Segment #248 [00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:23,740] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 可能背後
Segment #249 [00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:25,220] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 不會帶來成長
Segment #250 [00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:26,380] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 你才能擁有他
Segment #251 [00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:28,080] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是你還能去這樣做
Segment #252 [00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:29,500] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 哪怕是面人的不理解
Segment #253 [00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:31,960] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 我感覺這才叫幫助
Segment #254 [00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:32,860] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 1  | Text: 我要
Segment #255 [00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,080] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 我把麥克風給你
Segment #256 [00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,620] | Elapsed: 216.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你感覺我天天罵你
